 "notes": "Governor: Garotinho (Republicanos) was ruled ineligible by the TRE on 11 Sep 2026 (per en.wikipedia) but pollsters kept him in their main scenario through late September (presumably running sub judice); rows use the WITH-Garotinho scenario throughout. Several pollsters (AtlasIntel, RTBD, Paraná) also publish a scenario without him where Ruas gains ~3-6 pts (e.g. AtlasIntel 15-20 Sep: Paes 44.4, Ruas 38.2; Paraná 20-22 Sep: Paes 46.3, Ruas 28.8; RTBD 9-12 Sep: Paes 36, Ruas 27) - switch if Garotinho is off the ballot. Outros = Cyro Garcia (PSTU), Juliete Pantoja (UP), Luan Monteiro (PCO) plus, in older rows, withdrawn minor names: Paraná 2026-06-03 (Wilson Witzel 3.1 + Bombeiro Rafa Luz 2.6; no Busnello), Gerp 2026-07-15 (scenario 2: Witzel 3; no Busnello/Siri), Quaest 2026-07-25 (Witzel 1). No usable Jan-May polls found (the PL candidate was undefined before Ruas; April 2026 indirect special election for governor). Paraná Pesquisas and Datafolha (Aug) did not publish a 2nd round in some releases. Quaest 2026-09-07 senate: 'others 8% combined' was ambiguous, so Outros omitted.",
